{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-11-18 09:05:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS WINS SIX PARTNER OF THE YEAR AWARDS AT TSMC 2022 OIP ECOSYSTEM FORUM', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , NOV 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HIGHLIGHTS: SYNOPSYS HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A TSMC OIP PARTNER OF THE YEAR FOR 12 CONSECUTIVE YEARS AWARDS SPAN DIGITAL AND CUSTOM DESIGN, IP, AND CLOUD-BASED SOLUTIONS THE COLLABORATION IS DRIVING MULTI-DIE SYSTEMS AND DESIGN ON ADVANCED NODES DOWN TO 3NM HIGHLIGHTS INCLUDE CREATING A MILLIMETER WAVE (MMWAVE) RADIO FREQUENCY (RF) DESIGN FLOW SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ: SNPS) HAS BEEN SELECTED AS A TSMC OPEN INNOVATION PLATFORM® (OIP) PARTNER OF THE YEAR FOR THE TWELFTH CONSECUTIVE TIME, EARNING SIX AWARDS IN THE 2023 PROGRAM.'}